  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>As Magnet is approaching toward the loop magnetic flux increases and Rate of increment of flux also increases so emf increases with time</p><p><img src=\"assets\\st0077_d6df275e86b5.png\" style=\"width: 175px; height: 195px;\" />&nbsp;at this moment emf is maximum and negative</p><p><img src=\"assets\\st0077_f39dcf044d84.png\" style=\"width: 211px; height: 190px;\" />&nbsp;Magnet is in middle of coil, at this moment emf is equal to zero</p><p><img src=\"assets\\st0077_262b22499155.png\" style=\"width: 208px; height: 196px;\" />&nbsp;Now again flux start changing however polarity of emf get reverse</p><p><img src=\"assets\\st0077_845a9f58356d.png\" style=\"width: 185px; height: 219px;\" />&nbsp;At this moment emf is again maximum</p><p><img src=\"assets\\st0077_70ba2d086c9f.png\" style=\"width: 229px; height: 188px;\" />&nbsp;emf again become zero</p><p><img src=\"assets\\ot3_0077_819cbcd99d6f.png\" style=\"width: 341px; height: 229px;\" /></p>"
